{"id":"dfc7cea11adbf92d","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-cantor-diagonal.md","title":"Cantor's Diagonal Argument","display":"df-cantor-diagonal — Cantor's Diagonal Argument","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-cantor-diagonal","aliases":["90-df-cantor-diagonal"],"display":"df-cantor-diagonal — Cantor's Diagonal Argument","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-cantor-diagonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-cantor-diagonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cantor-diagonal — Cantor's Diagonal Argument"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\mathbb N}=\\{a:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\">\\(2^{\\mathbb N}=\\{a:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\\)</span> (Cantor 空间)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to2^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to2^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (任意候选枚举)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_f\\in2^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(d_f\\in2^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (diagonal sequence, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\nd_f(n)&amp;\\coloneqq1-f(n)(n),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;&amp;\\bigl(d_f(n)\\neq f(n)(n)\\bigr),\\\\\nd_f&amp;\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(f).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\nd_f(n)&amp;\\coloneqq1-f(n)(n),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;&amp;\\bigl(d_f(n)\\neq f(n)(n)\\bigr),\\\\\nd_f&amp;\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(f).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用二进制序列而非十进制实数展开，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0.0111\\ldots=0.1000\\ldots\">\\(0.0111\\ldots=0.1000\\ldots\\)</span> 一类表示非唯一性。</li>\n<li>因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_f\">\\(d_f\\)</span> 在第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 位不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n)\">\\(f(n)\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_f\\neq f(n)\">\\(d_f\\neq f(n)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 成立。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"2^{\\mathbb N}=\\{a:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to2^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"d_f\\in2^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\nd_f(n)&\\coloneqq1-f(n)(n),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;&\\bigl(d_f(n)\\neq f(n)(n)\\bigr),\\\\\nd_f&\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(f).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.","display":true},{"tex":"0.0111\\ldots=0.1000\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"d_f","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"f(n)","display":false},{"tex":"d_f\\neq f(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":929,"backlinks":[{"id":"9e014b6b595b8bd9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closu